### 🔎 Search Terms

generics, type deduction, nested generics, conditional type, type inferring 

### 🕗 Version & Regression Information

```
type Comparable<T> = T extends ComparableBase ? true : ( T extends Option<infer U> ? Comparable<U> : false);
```
is supported only after v4.1.5 and the function breaks for every version since that.

